<title>BELGIUM: Bekaert provisions plan for 2.9 bln bfr in 96.</title>
<headline>Bekaert provisions plan for 2.9 bln bfr in 96.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian steel cord and wire maker Bekaert on Thursday announced details of a far-reaching restructuring programme for which it will book gross financial provisions worth 2.91 billion francs ($83.3 million).</p>
<p>The full amount will be charged to the 1996 financial year, it said in a statement. It also said that there will be no layoffs. ($ = 34.94 Belgian Francs)</p>
